==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|Osamu Mikumo & Cat]], [[Yuma Kuga & Cat (Rare Cat)|Yuma Kuga & Cat]] and [[Chika Amatori & Cat (Special Cat)|Chika Amatori & Cat]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Marmod]] spawns.
*1 [[Marmod]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Marmod]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Marmod]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Marmod]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Black Marmod]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Marmod]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Red Marmod]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Albeit harder than its predecessors, it is still rather easy to do, even with level 20 units. Level 30 World Trigger units will render this stage a non-issue.

